    "helpful_mechanics": "Thinking happens while paused, and movement and firing can happen simultaneously. Many enemies have predictable patterns, cleared rooms provide safe navigation, and the minimap helps track exploration. Collectibles can improve damage and survivability, while hearts replenish health. Early milestones award substantial partial credit, and full points require reaching floor six rather than defeating Mom.",
